WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:08.880
So far all our operations have ended in failure.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.100
And all because of those interfering Mew Mews.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:18.180
You must dispose of those annoying Mew
Mews this time, once and for all.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:18.830
Understood.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.680
I’m afraid I have some bad news today.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.970
I think you’ve all realized that the enemy’s attacks are getting bolder.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:50.230
Just look at what happened with the Dome last time.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.090
Now something suspicious is going on in Tokyo Bay.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.950
We are observing an unprecedented number of Chimera Animas in and around the Bay.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:02.180
It’d be the end of Tokyo if they polluted
the sea which we depend on to live.

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.670
We must stop their plan before that happens.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.440
We can’t let them do whatever they want to the Earth.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.500
It’s a no-no to pollute the sea!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.420
Aoyama-kun is supporting me as a Mew Mew.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.590
I have to carefully protect the future of the Earth.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:19.220
Uhm...

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.180
I wonder if there is any way...

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.390
...that we and they can come to an understanding without the need to fight.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.730
It’s just like you to think that, Retasu,
but I doubt it’s possible.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:35.070
But they have feelings –
they have hearts too!

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:39.280
That’s why I’m sure they could understand!

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:45.080
Bu-Ling is beginning to understand
what you mean, Retasu-oneechan!

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:49.580
No. If we could sort this out by talking...

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.070
...there wouldn’t have been a reason to fight up to now.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.420
Remember how many people
have been hurt...

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:57.880
That’s true.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:03.430
Indeed, we’ve been fighting all this time, but Retasu is right...

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:07.890
Quiche and the others, have feelings too — have hearts...

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:26.120
I wish the Mew Mews did more than just fight.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.350
What’s that?

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.310
An ocean current generator.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.080
Huh? What’s that?

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.950
It’s a machine to make
a current in the sea.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.550
What’re you going to do with it?

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.920
I will use it to spread pollutants in the Bay of Tokyo...

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:44.140
...in order to wipe out all the creatures in the area.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.100
Spread pollutants? How?

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:52.430
Currently I am bringing up a Chimera Anima in the water below the machine.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:58.050
When she is grown up, she’ll be huge,
her body filled with pollutants.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.730
She will then release the pollutants into the sea.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.200
Heh.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:09.390
But what if the Mew Mews find her?

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.170
That’s the point.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.440
I will release many Chimera Animas in the Bay area.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:19.510
They will keep the Mew Mews away from the sea.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.280
Sounds like a plan.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.820
We won’t need much time.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.680
By the time they find out they’ve
been tricked, it will be too late.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:39.110
We have observed a lot of Chimera
Animas in and around this area.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:43.070
We’ve got two boats so we’ll split into two groups.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.930
Ichigo, Bu-Ling and Retasu will
search inside the Bay with me.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:47.580
OK?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.560
Yes.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.060
Waaaaiii, a boat trip!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.250
Bu-Ling, we’re not here
to enjoy ourselves.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.350
Zakuro and Minto, you will stay on the sea with Keiichirou

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.010
...so you can react immediately if Chimera Animas appear.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.510
And then, Masha.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.430
Wha-at?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.910
Masha, you will look from above
for suspicious movements.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.460
Roger! Roger!

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.380
OK! Let’s go!

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:22.680
Yahoo! Fun, fun!

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:23.820
It’s freezing cold!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.140
Our first priority is to check the sea.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.620
The sea...

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.110
Wait, you don’t mean we dive into
the sea and check there!?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.480
Yes! You just read my mind.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.590
Come on, it’s the middle of winter.
We’ll freeze to death!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.910
Yahoo, Bu-Ling loves sea bathing!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.160
THIS isn’t sea bathing!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:50.600
Ok, I’ll leave that job up to you, Ichigo and Bu-Ling.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:56.650
Ichigo oneechan, this is our duty!
Synchronized swimming!

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:02.980
Synchronized swimming is supposed to be more elegant.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.770
Well, they could have used these wet suits...

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.890
You should’ve said that earlier!

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.750
I’m freezing.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.670
Ichigo, how is it in the sea?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.530
Well it’s cold after all.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.880
Bu-Ling is having lots of fun!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:28.370
Ok, report if you find anything.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:29.560
I will...

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.050
A storm is on the way.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.650
You can tell because of this breeze from the west.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.630
Zephyr...

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:44.510
Yes, that’s one name for it.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:48.390
Yes, l heard that the wind from the west brings the storm,

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:52.810
then brings happiness when the storm has passed.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.080
I see.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.030
I believe in that saying.

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:05.010
Yahoo! I’ve got the sea all to myself!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:15.250
Amazing! I thought the Tokyo Bay would
be much dirtier, but I was wrong.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.460
Wow, so many fish!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:20.760
How cute!

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.650
It’s not too bad after all if I can
see something this wonderful.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:32.350
This is the world that we should protect.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:37.110
I can’t forgive those who are trying
to pollute nature’s beauty.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.940
I must stop them, definitely!

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:41.550
Ichigo-oneechan!!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.550
What is it, Bu-Ling?

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.750
Look at that! Coming this way!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.420
A huge group of creepy fish!

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.390
Chimera Animas?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.750
What’s wrong, Ichigo?

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.710
This is bad! A huge group of Chimera Animas are swimming up to the surface!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.350
What?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.860
Whoa, there are so many of them!

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.200
Ah, lchigo-san!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:14.640
They’ve changed all the Mr. Fishes into Chimera Animas!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:15.910
Everyone, transform!

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:20.690
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.420
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:41.290
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.010
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.570
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:56.310 --> 00:07:58.080
I’m counting on all of you. Now, go!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.120
StrawberBell!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.950
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.800
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.850
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.370
Pudding Kick!

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.080
Just how many of these things are there?!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.120
Start the boat. There are too many.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.550
Hey, Keiichirou, don’t you think something odd is going on?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.700
Indeed.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.260
I can’t see the reason why they would send
so many Chimera Animas to this empty place.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.300
Tsk, he discovered it.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:19.200
Well I guess it’s okay. The Chimera
Anima is almost ready anyway.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.730
They’re chasing us!

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:26.330
Let’s go ashore. We’re at a disadvantage at sea.

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:27.790
Masha!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.710
What’s going on, Keiichirou?

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:33.710
Masha emitted a short warning then his signal vanished!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:34.990
What?

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.050
Let’s go to where Masha got lost, Shirogane!

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.790
Yes, but we have to do something about those fish too.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.000
Mew Lettuce, come with me.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:44.710
Yes!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.500
The rest of you take care of the Chimera Animas!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.060
Ok.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.350
Alright!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.050
Where did we lose Masha?

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.470
The point X-1. It’s in the sea.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.510
Keiichirou, distract their attention from me.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:00.980
OK. Be careful.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.330
Everyone, let’s go!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.330
What the? What is this current?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.230
Shirogane-san?

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.610
Shirogane-san!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.010
Chimera Anima!

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.510
I don’t have time to fight you now!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.170
Please, move aside!

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:11.980
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.730
SHIROGANE-SAN!!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.670
Akasaka-san, at this rate they’ll catch up to us!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:41.010
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.140
That won’t work. Take that!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.760
Well? Are you upset?

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.920
Taru-taru, why did you do that?!

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.860
Hey, don’t call me “Taru-taru”!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.700
Even though you’re my friend, I must
punish you if you do bad things!

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:09.540
What? It’s you humans who do bad things!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:13.690
Even so, what you are doing is a no-no, Taru-taru!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:18.340
Before you started, those fish were
swimming peacefully around!

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:22.380
Th-That’s got nothing to do with me!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.920
I must hurry. I must hurry and save him!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.890
The color of her body is changing...?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:44.680
Shirogane-san!

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.650
What...? Why?

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:57.130
Shirogane-san! SHIROGANE-SAAAN!!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.140
It’s time.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.520
Everyone, get the Chimera Animas into the Bay!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:21.050
Alright! OK...!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:24.400
Wait, no good will come of repeating what we did before.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.020
Let’s use a PuddingRings to catch them all at once.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.790
I can’t! I’ve never made such a big PuddingRings.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.960
If the Mint Echo is used at the same time, it has to work.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:40.960
But what if Taru-taru interferes again?

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:42.700
I’ll take care of him.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:48.700
Ichigo, we can’t stop them for more than a few seconds.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.890
Ok, so the timing is important.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.700
Yup!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.850
Everyone, let’s go!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:14:01.810
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:06.400
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.450
Heeey...!

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.910
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.150
Wah, it’s breaking.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.710
Mew Strawberry, hurry!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:31.000
Reborn Strawberry Surprise.

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.150
YAY...!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.050
Hrm, don’t get too full of yourselves.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.610
You only fought a decoy anyway.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.640
By now, I bet...

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.230
See ya!

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.970
Everyone, let’s hurry to where Shirogane is.

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:55.790
We will!

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.750
Shirogane-san, where are you?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.080
If you die, I... I...

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:09.680
That light!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.790
A drop of the Mew Aqua?

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.250
Shirogane-san!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.420
Ku Ryu Sen! (Flow-Generating-Fan)

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:25.770
You are...? Please, get out of my way!

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:29.980
If I said I wouldn’t, would you kill me?

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:37.450
I beg of you! I... only... want to save him!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:42.500
As for you, you also have something important something you want to protect!

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:02.480
There is no way that you can compare
us to you foolish humans!

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.870
Shirogane-san. Anyone else but him!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:26.990
What?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.140
That is...!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.170
Don’t die, please.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:57.890
How foolish...

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.640
The Chimera Anima will soon release the pollutants.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:03.400
What you did was beautiful, but also pointless.

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:07.730
That is...

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:10.410
I bet that was the enemy’s real plan!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.840
Something is in the center of the swirl!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:18.800
Leave that to me!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.770
Reborn Pomegran’ spear!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.720
You did it!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.470
What’s THAT?

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.060
That Chimera Anima...

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:43.290
...is BIG!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.290
And she’s angry!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:03.080
Mew Lettuce! She has transformed into a mermaid again!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:07.120
The power of Ryo’s Mew Aqua piece has been released!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.690
Now’s your chance, Mew Strawberry!

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:09.560
Yes.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:31.130
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.880
“Something you want to protect”, huh?

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:00.450
Shirogane-san.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.150
Shirogane-san! Shirogane-san!!

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:10.960
Shi-Shirogane-san..

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.540
Retasu.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.490
I’m so glad... really glad.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:18.120
Retasu!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.550
Retasu-oneechan!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:23.550
Everyone?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:28.020
Ryou! Retasu-san! You’re OK, right?

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.480
Well, I guess so.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:37.920
Don’t worry, Ryou. The ladies completely
took care of the Chimera Anima.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.100
Yay!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.510
Masha...

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:43.850
Wah, there’s Masha!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:46.770
Oh my God, Masha, are you Ok?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.660
Poor thing, all worn out..

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.810
Akasaka-san, what’ll we do?

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:54.730
Don’t worry, the damage is minor.
I can fix him in no time.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.730
Masha’s so strong!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.070
Thank you. You saved me.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:02.410
You’re welcome... I’m glad... I’m so glad...

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.150
Sorry!

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:11.500
Hey, let me on the boat already.
I’m almost frozen!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:15.340
Oh, what will we do?
This boat only holds five people!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:16.340
Eh?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.640
Haha, Akasaka-san is so mean!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.490
Oh, dear Zakuro-oneesama.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:31.260
A while ago I just admired you from afar, but now you are with me.

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.790
Look! Zakuro-san is in yet another magazine.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:38.260
Of course she’s always attractive,
even in a magazine,

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:41.640
but now the real thing is always with me...

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.560
Eh?! But this article says she’s moving to the US.

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.000
WHAT!?

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.440
Next: “Zakuro’s Dilemma:
Only 4 Mew Mews Now?”

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.950
Oneesama! Tell me it’s a lie!
